---
import ElementLayout from '../../layouts/ElementLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig, siteUrl } from '../../config/site.ts';

const title = `Elemen #5: Perencanaan & Prosedur — ${siteConfig.siteName}`;
const description = 'Dokumen operasional terstandarisasi: SOP/SWP untuk pekerjaan risiko tinggi, Permit to Work (PTW), Emergency Response Plan, dan Management of Change (MOC).';
const image = siteUrl('/images/csms-elements/elemen-5-perencanaan.svg');
const seoImage = siteUrl('/images/csms-elements/elemen-5-perencanaan.svg', true);

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Elemen CSMS', href: '/csms-elements' },
  { label: 'Perencanaan & Prosedur', href: '/csms-elements/perencanaan-prosedur' }
];
---
<ElementLayout title={title} description={description} image={seoImage} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} elementId={5}>
  <header slot="header" class="elemen-header text-center mb-16">
        <span class="inline-block bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 font-bold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4">Elemen #5</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl mb-4">Perencanaan & Prosedur</h1>
        <p class="text-center text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">SOP/SWP pekerjaan risiko tinggi, PTW system, Emergency Response Plan, Management of Change (MOC).</p>
        <div class="elemen-header-media flex justify-center">
          <img src={image} alt="Ilustrasi Perencanaan & Prosedur CSMS" class="w-full max-w-2xl h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-gray-100" />
        </div>
      </header>
          <article class="elemen-article bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Deskripsi Elemen</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Elemen ini menerjemahkan manajemen risiko menjadi dokumen operasional yang actionable. Termasuk: SOP (Standard Operating Procedure) & SWP (Safe Work Practice) untuk pekerjaan risiko tinggi, sistem Permit to Work (PTW) untuk high-risk activities (confined space, hot work, work at height, lifting, dll), Emergency Response Plan (ERP) yang diuji berkala, dan Management of Change (MOC) untuk setiap perubahan fasilitas, prosedur, personel, atau regulasi.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Prosedur harus: tertulis, tersosialisasi, diakses mudah, direview berkala, dan terversi. Auditor memeriksa apakah prosedur benar-benar dipakai di lapangan (bukan cuma di lemari), dan apakah PTW diterbitkan & ditutup dengan benar.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="elemen-article bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Mengapa Elemen Ini Penting?</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
              <li><strong>Konsistensi:</strong> Prosedur standar menghilangkan variasi cara kerja yang berisiko.</li>
              <li><strong>Kontrol high-risk:</strong> PTW memastikan risk assessment & approval sebelum pekerjaan berbahaya.</li>
              <li><strong>Kesiapsiagaan darurat:</strong> ERP yang diuji menyelamatkan nyawa saat insiden nyata.</li>
              <li><strong>Kendali perubahan:</strong> MOC mencegah insiden akibat modifikasi tidak terkontrol.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="elemen-article bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Deliverable Umum (Bukti Verifikasi)</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>Daftar Master SOP/SWP (kode, judul, revisi, tanggal review)</li>
              <li>SOP/SWP lengkap untuk: confined space, hot work, work at height, lifting, dll</li>
              <li>Form & prosedur Permit to Work (request, approval, monitoring, closing)</li>
              <li>Emergency Response Plan: skenario, prosedur, kontak darurat, titik kumpul</li>
              <li>Bukti drill ERP (min. 1x setahun) & evaluasi hasil drill</li>
              <li>Prosedur & form Management of Change (MOC)</li>
              <li>Bukti review & approval MOC untuk perubahan signifikan</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="elemen-article bg-primary-50 p-8 rounded-xl border border-primary-200">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-900 mb-4">Bagaimana Kami Membantu</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-primary-800 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>Menyusun <strong>SOP/SWP</strong> custom per jenis pekerjaan & sektor industri</li>
              <li>Membangun sistem <strong>Permit to Work</strong> (form, alur, register, pelatihan)</li>
              <li>Mengembangkan <strong>Emergency Response Plan</strong> & mengkoordinasikan drill</li>
              <li>Membuat prosedur & template <strong>Management of Change (MOC)</strong></li>
              <li>Audit kepatuhan prosedur di lapangan (compliance check)</li>
            </ul>
          </article>


  <div slot="aside" class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Navigasi 9 Elemen</h3>
            <nav class="space-y-2">
              <a href="/csms-elements/kepemimpinan-komitmen" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #1: Kepemimpinan & Komitmen</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/kebijaksanaan-sasaran" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #2: Kebijaksanaan & Sasaran</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/organisasi-tanggungjawab" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #3: Organisasi & Tanggung Jawab</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/manajemen-risiko" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #4: Manajemen Risiko</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/perencanaan-prosedur" class="block bg-primary-50 text-primary-800 p-3 rounded-lg font-medium border border-primary-200">→ Elemen #5: Perencanaan & Prosedur</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/implementasi-pemantauan" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #6: Implementasi & Pemantauan</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/audit-tinjauan" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #7: Audit & Tinjauan</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/pencapaian-kinerja" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #8: Pencapaian Kinerja</a>
              <a href="/csms-elements/pencapaian-lainnya" class="block text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">Elemen #9: Pencapaian Lainnya</a>
            </nav>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white p-6 rounded-xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Butuh Bantuan Elemen #5?</h3>
            <p class="text-primary-100 mb-4 text-sm">Kami bantu SOP/SWP, sistem PTW, ERP & drill darurat, prosedur MOC, audit kepatuhan.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary-600 font-medium px-5 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors text-sm">Konsultasi Gratis</a>
          </div>
        </div>
</ElementLayout>